        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S41/4058BU,  4\" x 4-1/4\" x 5/8\" Radius Leaf x Square Corner Leaf Fiber Glass Door Hinge with Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold and priced as a pair, these 4\" security door hinges are made out of steel. They have a 5/8\" radius on one leaf and a square corner on the other. For use on Jeld-Wen doors and fiber glass doors that open outward where the hinge pins are outside the door. The Fiber Glass Door Hinge with Ball Bearings have locking tabs that join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed--making them great as extra security door hinges. This holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut). These steel hinges have 2 ball bearings. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2). Utilizes zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S41-4058BU-specifications.gif?v=1704442283\" width=\"593\" height=\"266\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S41/4058BU Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 x 4-1/4 Fiber Glass Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Dual Ball-Bearings: 2 BB</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.092\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Tabs: Lock Tab to Join Hinge Leaves</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S41-4058BU-specifications.pdf?v=1704262339\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S41/4058BU Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>This item is Discontinued. Use <a href=\"/products/4-x-4-1-4-x-5-8-radius-leaf-x-square-corner-for-fiber-glass-doors-pair-deltana-s41-4058u\">Deltana S41/4058U</b></a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
